SUMMARY:Continental Philosophy Research Group (Kaitlyn Creasy\, CSU Bernardino)
DESCRIPTION:The Continental Philosophy Research Interest Group welcomes guest speaker Kaitlyn Creasy\, a professor and chair of the philosophy department at California State University\, San Bernardino. In addition to working in 19th-century European philosophy and moral psychology\, she works on meaning in life and issues at the intersection of ethics\, the philosophy of emotion\, and social philosophy. \nTalk Title\nTBA \nTalk Abstract\nTBA
